  "reasoning": "The defendant, while holding a position of trust within a private law firm, repeatedly altered check amounts and diverted portions of attorney fees, permanently appropriating firm funds totaling 94,897.64 RMB. This conduct fits the definition of 职务侵占 (embezzlement by a person in a position of authority) rather than temporary misappropriation of specific funds. No other criminal conduct is indicated.",
  "final_answer": "[罪名]职务侵占<eoa>"
